{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Fret</i>\u00a0is a first-person psychological mascot-horror puzzle game, where music and horror intertwine in novel and unfamiliar ways. Navigate the hallways of Harmonic Heights as Fret, a talented young guitar in search of a way back home.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET FRET - THE LIVING INSTRUMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Fret, a sentient guitar trapped in a nightmare of music and madness. Navigate the decaying halls of Harmonic Heights, uncover its secrets, and confront the horrors of this musical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A STYLIZED WORLD OF SOUND AND FEAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/db3c373a492c024a820141d2e2c4c1fb.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Don\u2019t Fret,</i>\u00a0every instrument, hallway, and shadow is alive with purpose. The game\u2019s art blends psychological horror with musical surrealism, creating a novel atmosphere that sets it apart from other indie horror titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A MASSIVE, MUSICAL WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/7bfc3db19fbc6b128790c0d6408fc3c5.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/7bfc3db19fbc6b128790c0d6408fc3c5.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/7bfc3db19fbc6b128790c0d6408fc3c5.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattering the boundaries of traditional indie horror, Fret's expansive world spans dozens of handcrafted environments \u2014 from classrooms and underground tunnels to campus courtyards, gondola rides, experimental medical facilities, holy places, and more.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A CINEMATIC NARRATIVE EXPERIENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/cf365e56ae51be44caad8ae68487e4a2.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/cf365e56ae51be44caad8ae68487e4a2.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/cf365e56ae51be44caad8ae68487e4a2.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t Fret</i> delivers a story-driven horror experience that unfolds through audio logs, inspectable items, and cinematic cutscenes seamlessly woven into gameplay. Unravel a tale of exploitation, performance, and identity as you descend into the nightmare of Harmonic Heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><strong> </strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN UNFORGETTABLE CAST</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/5477a13ddc3aa52d3bd0a4be5f7a3a74.avif?t=1761941058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras_big/5477a13ddc3aa52d3bd0a4be5f7a3a74.webp?t=1761941058 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extraordinary celebrity cast of voice talent delivers haunting, emotionally charged performances that pull players deep into the world. Their authenticity and power give voice to the fear, tension, and humanity at Don't Fret's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPTIVE ENEMY ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c49682df2b9870580409c2d5615f741e.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c49682df2b9870580409c2d5615f741e.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter in <i>Don\u2019t Fret</i> demands creativity. Some enemies are drawn to sound and movement, forcing you to be stealthy. Others are relentless, fast, and unpredictable, attacking from any angle. And some cannot be fought at all. You\u2019ll need to observe, listen, and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUSICAL PUZZLES AND INTERACTIVE INSTRUMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t Fret</i> features a range of music-based puzzles, including pianos, drums, guitars, and harps. Door locks utilize the G-PAD, a guitar-inspired lock requiring you to perform under pressure as enemies draw nearer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD SCORED BY ROCKIT MUSIC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/08e432157ffa94c8c15358f8e443688e.avif?t=1761941058\" width=506 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Composed by Russell McKamey of Rockit Music, pioneers of the Nerdcore music genre who have garnered over 400 million views and a thriving community of over 1 million subscribers on YouTube. Their expertise lies in crafting immersive soundscapes inspired by indie horror and pop culture, ensuring an electrifying auditory experience for deep enthusiasts and casual players alike.</strong><br> <br><strong>The Don't Fret soundtrack fuses cinematic orchestration with industrial horror... and it reacts to gameplay, evolving dynamically as you explore, hide, or fight, rhythmically ratcheting up the emotion of fear for truly tense gameplay.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't miss Don't Fret!\u00a0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716830?t=1761941058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2716830?t=1761941058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/fc3a4d1e6a16e514257cd0e379e1c56d61d35565/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761941058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/fc3a4d1e6a16e514257cd0e379e1c56d61d35565/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761941058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3202450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Fret</i>\u00a0is a first-person psychological mascot-horror puzzle game, where music and horror intertwine in novel and unfamiliar ways. Navigate the hallways of Harmonic Heights as Fret, a talented young guitar in search of a way back home.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET FRET - THE LIVING INSTRUMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/d7bc2cb7fce08110a751913dd7542ea5.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/