/5477a13ddc3aa52d3bd0a4be5f7a3a74.webp?t=1761941058 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extraordinary celebrity cast of voice talent delivers haunting, emotionally charged performances that pull players deep into the world. Their authenticity and power give voice to the fear, tension, and humanity at Don't Fret's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPTIVE ENEMY ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c49682df2b9870580409c2d5615f741e.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/c49682df2b9870580409c2d5615f741e.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter in <i>Don\u2019t Fret</i> demands creativity. Some enemies are drawn to sound and movement, forcing you to be stealthy. Others are relentless, fast, and unpredictable, attacking from any angle. And some cannot be fought at all. You\u2019ll need to observe, listen, and adapt to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MUSICAL PUZZLES AND INTERACTIVE INSTRUMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.poster.avif?t=1761941058\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.webm?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/4a54d21c9ec880fb1f255407bb614b0a.mp4?t=1761941058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don\u2019t Fret</i> features a range of music-based puzzles, including pianos, drums, guitars, and harps. Door locks utilize the G-PAD, a guitar-inspired lock requiring you to perform under pressure as enemies draw nearer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A WORLD SCORED BY ROCKIT MUSIC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/extras/08e432157ffa94c8c15358f8e443688e.avif?t=1761941058\" width=506 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Composed by Russell McKamey of Rockit Music, pioneers of the Nerdcore music genre who have garnered over 400 million views and a thriving community of over 1 million subscribers on YouTube. Their expertise lies in crafting immersive soundscapes inspired by indie horror and pop culture, ensuring an electrifying auditory experience for deep enthusiasts and casual players alike.</strong><br> <br><strong>The Don't Fret soundtrack fuses cinematic orchestration with industrial horror... and it reacts to gameplay, evolving dynamically as you explore, hide, or fight, rhythmically ratcheting up the emotion of fear for truly tense gameplay.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't miss Don't Fret!\u00a0</strong></p>","developers":["Scary Kid Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716830/b1da61a142653b11154d9f510bb7ca553ac858e9/header.jpg?t=1761941058","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Scary Kid Studios, LLC \u2013 All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul c